  "name": "ui/Keyboard Notes",
  "symbol": "scene_keyboard_notes",
  "notes": "Open Notes from the title-screen menu to edit a note. D-pad selects keys, A types, B deletes, Start saves, and Select toggles shift (double-tap to lock). The on-screen X cancels the current edit and returns to the title screen without changing the stored note. Text updates live on the background above the keyboard.",
